# Where the Vite dev server proxies the API (vite.config.ts). The browser
# always talks to the dev server's own origin, exactly as it talks to nginx in
# production, so the httpOnly session cookie and CSRF work unchanged.
VITE_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:8000

# Leave VITE_API_BASE_URL UNSET. Pointing it at another origin (for example
# http://localhost:8000) makes every API call cross-origin: session cookies are
# then neither sent nor stored, and nobody can sign in.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
